00:15:55,341 --> 00:15:56,961
No! No! No, I want a wide shot!

205
00:15:57,181 --> 00:15:58,801
That's enough! Okay, no more!

206
00:15:59,081 --> 00:16:00,741
No more!

207
00:16:00,901 --> 00:16:02,201
We want some more!

208
00:16:02,381 --> 00:16:03,621
What?

209
00:16:04,021 --> 00:16:05,201
No.

210
00:16:05,201 --> 00:16:06,061
I'm done.

211
00:16:06,221 --> 00:16:09,181
Maybe the Ruffians can tell us the point now?

212
00:16:09,381 --> 00:16:10,421
You better.

213
00:16:11,021 --> 00:16:12,181
Well then...

214
00:16:12,381 --> 00:16:14,741
'Cause you must be okay, right?

215
00:16:15,001 --> 00:16:21,121
Well, you know, I guess if the Ruffians are happy, we're happy.

216
00:16:21,321 --> 00:16:24,181
After all, we're protecting your smiles!

217
00:16:24,341 --> 00:16:25,661
Bow wow!

218
00:16:25,821 --> 00:16:27,521
Bow wow!

219
00:16:27,721 --> 00:16:30,421
Sensei here, let's show the Ruffians around Makai.

220
00:16:31,001 --> 00:16:32,481
Yeah! Okay!

221
00:16:32,621 --> 00:16:36,261
Our house! It's our house!

222
00:16:36,401 --> 00:16:41,581
Yeah, like this is our childhood home here in the Northwest Passage.

223
00:16:41,761 --> 00:16:43,001
Yeah, the Makai.

224
00:16:43,141 --> 00:16:46,501
What do you think? Do you like it?

225
00:16:46,821 --> 00:16:50,221
Oh, is it a little bit different than you expected?

226
00:16:50,501 --> 00:16:52,541
It's pretty nice.

227
00:16:52,541 --> 00:16:56,201
I mean, don't worry about the paint though.

228
00:16:56,341 --> 00:17:00,021
You know, we just got into a little bit of fun and mischief.

229
00:17:00,221 --> 00:17:04,181
Mama puppy and papa puppy are home right now.

230
00:17:04,361 --> 00:17:07,341
Yeah, don't worry about that. You can't see them at home.

231
00:17:07,521 --> 00:17:09,181
Wait, don't try!

232
00:17:09,181 --> 00:17:13,581
Northwest Passage is filled with lots of nature.

233
00:17:13,921 --> 00:17:16,561
Let's go take a closer look here.

234
00:17:16,721 --> 00:17:21,081
You see these, they grow wild, the wild dandelion balls.

235
00:17:21,241 --> 00:17:23,081
Dandelion balls!

236
00:17:23,301 --> 00:17:29,061
They're so fluffy, right? I love them so much. They're really nice to know, to just rest on it.
They're so fluffy, right? I love them so much. They're really nice to, you know, just rest on it.

237
00:17:29,321 --> 00:17:35,501
You know, some people because they grow wild and everything, they think they're a nuisance.
You know, some people, because they grow wild and everything, think they're a nuisance.

238
00:17:35,681 --> 00:17:38,461
But we love them!

239
00:17:38,721 --> 00:17:44,321
And you know, our moons, we have two moons.

240
00:17:44,321 --> 00:17:47,401
It's a bit different in the Northwest Passage, you know.

241
00:17:47,581 --> 00:17:53,861
And you know, it's because of the twin moons that mama puppy received the blessing and that we're here now.

242
00:17:54,261 --> 00:17:57,241
Don't you think this looks pretty?

243
00:17:57,241 --> 00:18:00,381
Just look up with the bow wow!

244
00:18:00,541 --> 00:18:04,501
Over this way, we have a stream.

245
00:18:04,981 --> 00:18:10,701
It's really fun playing it on hot days sometime, so many memories.
It's really fun playing in it on hot days sometimes. So many memories!

246
00:18:11,301 --> 00:18:13,981
And back over this way...

247
00:18:14,141 --> 00:18:19,501
Behold, bow wow!

248
00:18:19,661 --> 00:18:25,041
Right here, this is our legendary tree of promise.

249
00:18:25,201 --> 00:18:30,241
A very special part of our home, you know, we can't we can't be without it, right?

250
00:18:30,481 --> 00:18:35,501
And actually, it's even more beautiful at night.

251
00:18:35,661 --> 00:18:40,821
Well, you'll just have to take our word for it.

252
00:18:41,481 --> 00:18:44,321
Bow wow!

253
00:18:44,321 --> 00:18:50,121
We're so happy to be able to share our home like this with you.

254
00:18:50,261 --> 00:18:56,341
It's so special, and I'm looking forward to making so many more memories with you.

255
00:18:58,281 --> 00:19:01,421
Bow wow!

256
00:19:01,581 --> 00:19:07,821
Wait, this could be no other than what you guys got... kore wa...
Wait, this could be no other than what you guys got... This is...

257
00:19:08,221 --> 00:19:20,981
