258
00:19:21,821 --> 00:19:27,981
I never do anything of the sort! After all, the star of the show is finally here!

259
00:19:28,161 --> 00:19:30,801
You're meant the great Battle Chino?
You meant the great Battle Chino?

260
00:19:31,321 --> 00:19:40,501
The muffins have been waiting for me! Don't you hear it? The chanting my name! Bow wow! Bow wow! When we reach the opening act then...
The Ruffians have been waiting for me! Don't you hear it? The chanting of my name! Bow wow! Bow wow! When we reach the opening act then...

261
00:19:40,501 --> 00:19:44,341
Bow wow!

262
00:19:44,661 --> 00:19:47,061
Pero, you're just our pet, okay?

263
00:19:47,261 --> 00:19:51,201
And the nasty one at that, okay? You're not the star!

264
00:19:51,201 --> 00:19:59,531
No, I think it's time we put you in your place, boy!

265
00:20:00,272 --> 00:20:01,372
もう許してやる！
I'll forgive you now!

266
00:20:01,672 --> 00:20:02,212
やあ！
Yay!

267
00:20:02,372 --> 00:20:03,592
ほら、どうだ！
How's that?!

268
00:20:03,792 --> 00:20:05,032
やー！
Take that!

269
00:20:05,232 --> 00:20:06,952
やっと許してあげます。
Finally forgiving you.

270
00:20:07,152 --> 00:20:08,572
えへへ、どうだ！
Hehehe, how's that!

271
00:20:08,772 --> 00:20:10,072
参ったか！
Had enough?!

272
00:20:10,272 --> 00:20:12,412
ふっふっふ、私を誰だと思って…
Fufufu, who do you think I am...

273
