672
01:15:00,523 --> 01:15:05,343
Please continue to share that beautiful smile of yours with me, lots and lots, and I'll make sure that nothing can lay a paw on it! Sincerely, Your Fluffy Fuwawa~ BAU BAU!

673
01:15:22,333 --> 01:15:24,293
Ruffians!

674
01:15:24,613 --> 01:15:28,393
I can't believe we're finally here, after so long,

675
01:15:29,193 --> 01:15:33,553
I'm so happy we've been able to spend today together.

676
01:15:33,893 --> 01:15:43,293
To be honest, there were many hard times, times when we doubted ourselves and were frustrated with our own limits,

677
